Subject: [PATCH] [M159] [PageInfo] Close bubble synchronously on WebContents
 destruction

Original change's description:
> [PageInfo] Close bubble synchronously on WebContents destruction
>
> Call CloseNow() in PageInfoBubbleViewBase::WebContentsDestroyed() so the
> bubble widget, presenter, and delegates are destroyed before WebContents
> teardown finishes, removing the need for WeakPtr<WebContents> and
> per-method null checks.
>
> Fixed: 587263538
